l},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45},{"id":"fangji-q-f899209f36966e3edb7d","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-9873b022c02f57bac3ab","layer":"original","quote":"璩，六十一为侍中，直省内〖19〗，欻见白狗〖20〗；问之众人，悉无见者。于是数聚会，并急游观田里〖21〗，饮宴自娱；过期一年，六十三卒","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67},{"id":"liusima-q-5030dfc650541494d0d8","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-88ded8218a019af909a9","layer":"original","quote":"散骑常侍应璩书与靖曰","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":6,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":31},{"id":"liusima-q2-f6ba281881b29532bb5c","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-88ded8218a019af909a9","layer":"original","quote":"转在河内。迁尚书，赐爵关内侯。出为河南尹。散骑常侍应璩书与靖曰〖6〗：“入作纳言〖7〗，出临京任〖8〗。富民之术，日引月长：藩落高峻〖9〗，绝穿窬之心；五种别出〖10〗，远水火之灾；农器必具，无失时之阙〖11〗；蚕麦有苫备之用，无雨湿之虞；封符指期〖12〗，无流连之吏；鳏寡孤独，蒙廪赈之实。加之以明擿幽微，重之以秉宪不挠〖13〗；有司供承王命，百里垂拱仰办〖14〗：虽昔赵、张、三王之治〖15〗，未足以方也！”靖为政类如此。初虽如碎密〖16〗，终于百姓便之，有馥遗风。","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":6,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":235},{"id":"wangwei-q-3185074aa199693dc871","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-4107203c34921a600c2a","layer":"original","quote":"玚弟璩，璩子贞，咸以文章显。璩官至侍中。贞咸熙中参相国军事〖1〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":132,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36},{"id":"wangwei-q-359094b029b61a597486","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-0000c2d0cca1b750f0c4","layer":"pei","quote":"复为侍中，典著作","attribution":"裴注·文章叙录","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-57f197b8737f0115a918","start":91,"end":99},{"id":"wangwei-q-508bc6cd9a6a63b72284","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-0000c2d0cca1b750f0c4","layer":"pei","quote":"曹爽秉政，多违法度，璩为诗以讽焉。其言虽颇谐合，多切时要，世共传之","attribution":"裴注·文章叙录","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-57f197b8737f0115a918","start":57,"end":90},{"id":"wangwei-q-5535ad427f4e17f6f4e3","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-0000c2d0cca1b750f0c4","layer":"pei","quote":"嘉平四年卒，追赠卫尉","attribution":"裴注·文章叙录","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-57f197b8737f0115a918","start":100,"end":110},{"id":"wangwei-q-5bb8314e192090fa4f9b","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-0000c2d0cca1b750f0c4","layer":"pei","quote":"齐王即位，稍迁侍中、大将军长史","attribution":"裴注·文章叙录","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-57f197b8737f0115a918","start":41,"end":56},{"id":"wangwei-q-c901b2cca3bb70309fa4","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-0000c2d0cca1b750f0c4","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《文章叙录》曰：“璩字休琏。博学好属文，善为书记。文、明帝世，历官散骑常侍。齐王即位，稍迁侍中、大将军长史。曹爽秉政，多违法度，璩为诗以讽焉。其言虽颇谐合，多切时要，世共传之。复为侍中，典著作。嘉平四年卒，追赠卫尉。贞字吉甫，少以才闻，能谈论。正始中，夏侯玄盛有名势。贞尝在玄坐，作五言诗，玄嘉玩之。举高第，历显位。晋武帝为抚军大将军，以贞参军事。晋室践阼，迁太子中庶子、散骑常侍。又以儒学，与太尉荀顗撰定《新礼》；事未施行。泰始五年卒。贞弟纯。纯子绍，永嘉中为黄门侍郎，为司马越所杀。纯弟秀。秀子詹，镇南大将军、江州刺史。”","attribution":"裴注引《文章叙录》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-57f197b8737f0115a918","start":0,"end":266},{"id":"wangwei-q-cd5c7d4336a52ee16add","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-0000c2d0cca1b750f0c4","layer":"pei","quote":"文、明帝世，历官散骑常侍","attribution":"裴注·文章叙录","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-57f197b8737f0115a918","start":28,"end":40},{"id":"wangwei-q-d2a7874c8574ff31f885","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-4107203c34921a600c2a","layer":"original","quote":"玚弟璩，璩子贞，咸以文章显。璩官至侍中。","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":132,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
